The symmetrically positioned hands of her alarm clock\ndisplayed the time as 10:10 PM.%K%P
过了２２点１０分，\n闹钟的长针与短针，变得左右对称。%K%P
Yet despite the time, the owner of the room was not\npresent.%K%P
可是，都到了这个时候，\n这个房间的主人却依然漂泊在外。%K%P
