It wasn't like we had a curfew going on. In fact,\nconsidering our bathing situation and Mitoko's delivery\njob, she was actually out and about quite frequently.%K%P
这里并没有存在门禁。\n不仅如此，因为送报纸和去洗澡之类的事，\n她深夜外出有如家常便饭。%K%P
Still...%K%P
可是…%K%P
This was the first time she vanished without warning.%K%P
半夜三更，连去向都不说一声的『出门一趟』，\n绝不是美都子平日的做派。%K%P
