After confirming Tsuyoshi's innocence, I spent another\nfifteen minutes searching for her in vain.%K%P
证明了刚志君的清白（？）之后，\n我又来回折腾了几十分钟，\n但还是没有找到美都子的蛛丝马迹。%K%P
According to Tsuyoshi, Mitoko left in the direction of the\nTerrace House Hinosaka after they separated at the\nstation's Shanzeriya.%K%P
根据他所说的，在车站前的香泽里拉分别之后，\n她确实是朝着Terrace House阳之坂的方向走回去了。%K%P
But that route would have taken her through the\nresidential area, with barely any passersby around to see\nher.%K%P
可是，那前面是住宅街。\n少有人经过，就连目击者都很难找到。%K%P
